# jupiterportfolio

## Git
After app code changes: run `npm run build`, conventional commit, push `origin/main` unless told otherwise. No amend/force-push unless requested.

## Media in frames
Artwork, process swatches, and About timelapse use `object-fit: contain` and frames that hug intrinsic aspect ratio — never `object-fit: cover`.

## Ornaments
Use SVGs under `public/assets/artdeco/`. Dividers: `diamond` or `crest` only — never sunburst/alchemy contact badges. UI sparkles: four-pointed star (`star.svg` / clip-path), not rotated squares.

## Gallery / modal
Desktop gallery: horizontal strip; mobile: stacked. Modal: image-only overview. Timelapse caption outside the video frame.
